#: sh/hivexsh.c:161
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Welcome to hivexsh, the hivex interactive shell for examining\n"
"Windows Registry binary hive files.\n"
"\n"
"Type: 'help' for help summary\n"
"      'quit' to quit the shell\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Laipni lūdzam hivexsh — hivex interaktīvajā čaulā Windows reģistra\n"
"bināro stropu failu apskatei.\n"
"\n"
"Ievadiet: 'help', lai redzētu palīdzības kopsavilkumu\n"
"          'quit', lai izietu no čaulas\n"
"\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:275
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: error getting parent of node %zu\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: kļūda, iegūstot mezgla %zu vecākmezglu\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:285
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: error getting node name of node %zx\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: kļūda, iegūstot mezgla %zx nosaukumu\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:424
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: you must load a hive file first using 'load hivefile'\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: vispirms jāielādē stropa fails ar 'load stropa_fails'\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:445
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: unknown command '%s', use 'help' for help summary\n"
msgstr ""
"hivexsh: nezināma komanda '%s'; palīdzības kopsavilkumam izmantojiet 'help'\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:455
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: load: no hive file name given to load\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: load: nav norādīts ielādējamā stropa faila nosaukums\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:471
#, c-format
msgid ""
"hivexsh: failed to open hive file: %s: %m\n"
"\n"
"If you think this file is a valid Windows binary hive file (_not_\n"
"a regedit *.reg file) then please run this command again using the\n"
"hivexsh option '-d' and attach the complete output _and_ the hive file\n"
"which fails into a bug report at https://bugzilla.redhat.com/\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"hivexsh: neizdevās atvērt stropa failu: %s: %m\n"
"\n"
"Ja uzskatāt, ka šis ir derīgs Windows binārais stropa fails (_nevis_\n"
"regedit *.reg fails), lūdzu, palaidiet šo komandu vēlreiz ar\n"
"hivexsh opciju '-d' un pievienojiet visu izvadi _un_ stropa failu,\n"
"kuru neizdodas atvērt, kļūdas ziņojumam vietnē https://bugzilla.redhat.com/\n"
"\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:504 sh/hivexsh.c:613 sh/hivexsh.c:1099
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: '%s' command should not be given arguments\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: komandai '%s' nedrīkst norādīt argumentus\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:546
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s: %s: \\ characters in path are doubled - are you escaping the path "
"parameter correctly?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s: %s: \\ rakstzīmes ceļā ir dubultotas — vai pareizi ievietojat ceļa "
"parametru atsoļa secībās?\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:584
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: cd: subkey '%s' not found\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: cd: apakšatslēga '%s' nav atrasta\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:602
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Navigate through the hive's keys using the 'cd' command, as if it\n"
"contained a filesystem, and use 'ls' to list the subkeys of the\n"
"current key.  Full documentation is in the hivexsh(1) manual page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pārvietojieties pa stropa atslēgām ar komandu 'cd' tā, it kā tas\n"
"būtu failu sistēma, un ar 'ls' parādiet pašreizējās atslēgas\n"
"apakšatslēgas.  Pilna dokumentācija ir hivexsh(1) rokasgrāmatas lapā.\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:681
#, c-format
msgid "%s: %s: key not found\n"
msgstr "%s: %s: atslēga nav atrasta\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:873 sh/hivexsh.c:977 sh/hivexsh.c:1003 sh/hivexsh.c:1032
#, c-format
msgid "%s: %s: invalid integer parameter (%s returned %u)\n"
msgstr "%s: %s: nederīgs veselā skaitļa parametrs (%s atgrieza %u)\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:878 sh/hivexsh.c:983 sh/hivexsh.c:1009 sh/hivexsh.c:1038
#, c-format
msgid "%s: %s: integer out of range\n"
msgstr "%s: %s: veselais skaitlis ir ārpus diapazona\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:900 sh/hivexsh.c:918
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: setval: unexpected end of input\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: setval: negaidītas ievades beigas\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:939 sh/hivexsh.c:958
#, c-format
msgid ""
"hivexsh: string(utf16le): only 7 bit ASCII strings are supported for input\n"
msgstr ""
"hivexsh: string(utf16le): ievadei tiek atbalstītas tikai 7 bitu ASCII "
"virknes\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:1069
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: setval: trailing garbage after hex string\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: setval: aiz heksadecimālās virknes ir lieki dati\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:1076
#, c-format
msgid ""
"hivexsh: setval: cannot parse value string, please refer to the man page "
"hivexsh(1) for help: %s\n"
msgstr ""
"hivexsh: setval: nevar parsēt vērtības virkni, palīdzību skatiet "
"rokasgrāmatas lapā hivexsh(1): %s\n"

#: sh/hivexsh.c:1105
#, c-format
msgid "hivexsh: del: the root node cannot be deleted\n"
msgstr "hivexsh: del: saknes mezglu nevar dzēst\n"

#: xml/hivexml.c:80
#, c-format
msgid "%s: failed to write XML document\n"
msgstr "%s: neizdevās ierakstīt XML dokumentu\n"

#: xml/hivexml.c:116
#, c-format
msgid "hivexml: missing name of input file\n"
msgstr "hivexml: trūkst ievades faila nosaukuma\n"

#: xml/hivexml.c:135
#, c-format
msgid "xmlNewTextWriterFilename: failed to create XML writer\n"
msgstr "xmlNewTextWriterFilename: neizdevās izveidot XML rakstītāju\n"
